    strat_dca_alloc: { en: '<strong>⚖️ Weekly Investments (Dynamic Allocation):</strong><br>• <strong>Sunny Climate (Score &gt; 0.4):</strong> Reduce purchases to 25% (Wait for pullback).<br>• <strong>Cloudy Climate (Score -0.4 to 0.4):</strong> Standard 100% investment (regular DCA).<br>• <strong>Stormy Climate (Score &lt; -0.4):</strong> Aggressive 200% investment (buy the dip).' },
